  "summaries": {
    "en": "Co-op optimized guide for Resident Evil 5—resource sharing, Mercenaries mode tips, and Professional difficulty strategies.",
    "ja": "バイオハザード5の協力プレイ最適化攻略。リソース共有、マーセナリーズモード攻略、プロフェッショナル難易度戦略を解説。"
  },
  "category": "survival-horror",
  "difficulty": "intermediate",
  "thumbnail": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551103782-8ab07afd45c1?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop",
  "keyPoints": {
    "en": [
      "RE5 is built around co-op synergy—resource distribution between Chris and Sheva should be role-based: Chris carries firearms and health sprays; Sheva carries ammo reserves and First Aid Spray as the secondary healer.",
      "Melee attacks after stagger (shooting an enemy in the knee or face) deal massive damage and conserve ammunition; prioritize melee attacks on standard Majini rather than expending full magazine.",
      "Inventory management is a persistent challenge—each character has only 9 inventory slots; selling old weapons to the merchant between chapters and upgrading remaining weapons maximizes efficiency.",
      "Egg items (Bird Egg, Rotten Egg) found in the environment serve as healing items or can be thrown at enemies for stunning effects; do not discard eggs automatically.",
      "For Professional difficulty, both players must internalize patrol routes in every encounter area; surprise Majini ambushes on Professional deal lethal damage on first contact."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "RE5は協力シナジーを中心に構築。クリスとシェバ間のリソース配分は役割ベースで。クリスは銃器とヘルスポーションを、シェバは弾薬備蓄と副ヒーラーとしてファーストエイドスプレーを携行。",
      "よろめき後の近接攻撃（膝や顔を撃った後）は大ダメージを与え弾薬を節約する。通常マジニにはフルマガジンより近接攻撃を優先する。",
      "インベントリ管理が継続的な課題。各キャラクターは9スロットのみ。章間でマーチャントに旧武器を売り残りの武器をアップグレードして効率を最大化する。",
      "環境で見つかる卵アイテム（鳥の卵・腐卵）は回復アイテムとして、または敵への投擲でスタン効果として使える。自動的に捨てないこと。",
      "プロフェッショナル難易度では、両プレイヤーが全遭遇エリアのパトロールルートを把握する必要がある。プロでの不意打ちマジニの奇襲は初接触で致命的なダメージを与える。"
    ]
  },
  "opening": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Setting Up Your Co-op Roles",
        "body": "In online co-op, establish clear role distribution before the run begins. The primary shooter (typically Chris) maintains battlefield control and primary engagement, while the support player (Sheva) manages healing items and covers entry points. Communicate resource requests explicitly—Sheva AI is notorious for consuming healing items inefficiently if left unmanaged by the second player, so human-controlled Sheva is strongly recommended for any serious playthrough."
      }
    ]
  },
  "midGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Weapon Upgrade Priority",
        "body": "The merchant between chapters allows selling unused weapons and upgrading retained ones. For a co-op run, prioritize upgrading one weapon per character to full capacity before diversifying: Shotgun (Chris) and Magnum or Sniper (Sheva) cover the most encounter types efficiently. Flash grenades become critical in the mid-game Popokarimu boss fight and several Majini ambush sections—conserve them from Chapter 1."
      }
    ]
  },
  "endGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Mercenaries Mode and Rank S",
        "body": "Mercenaries mode unlocks after main story completion and challenges players to kill as many enemies as possible within a time limit. Rank S (S-tier score) on all maps is required for full completion unlock. Key Mercenaries techniques: chain kills within 5 seconds to extend time, prioritize Chainsaw Majini kills for 10-second bonuses, and coordinate melee-stagger-kill chains between both players for maximum time extension per kill."
      }
    ]
  },
  "mistakes": {
    "en": [
      "Splitting up in tight corridors—RE5 is designed for close-range partner support; separating by more than one screen distance disables mutual covering fire and partner resurrection.",
      "Not managing AI Sheva's item consumption—in solo play, Sheva AI will use First Aid Sprays from her inventory regardless of player health status; give her only items you want her to use freely.",
      "Ignoring the proximity to Sheva for partner recovery—Sheva can revive Chris and vice versa within a 3-second window before permanent death; staying within quick reach makes partner saves feasible.",
      "Wasting Magnum ammunition on regular Majini—Magnum ammunition is extremely scarce; reserve Magnum shots for Chainsaw Majini, Iron Maiden, and the Uroboros boss encounters.",
      "Not utilizing the knife for conserving ammo against downed enemies—enemies knocked to the ground can be killed with a single knife execution, saving valuable ammunition for standing combat."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "狭い通路で分かれる。RE5はパートナーの近接サポートのために設計されている。1画面以上離れると相互援護射撃とパートナー蘇生が無効になる。",
      "AIシェバのアイテム消費を管理しない。ソロプレイでは、シェバAIはプレイヤーの体力状態に関わらずインベントリからファーストエイドスプレーを使用する。自由に使ってほしいアイテムのみ渡す。",
      "パートナー救助のためのシェバとの近接性を無視する。シェバはクリスを蘇生でき、逆も然り、永久死亡前の3秒ウィンドウ内で。素早い救助のために手の届く距離を保つ。",
      "通常マジニにマグナム弾を無駄にする。マグナム弾は極めて希少。チェーンソーマジニ・鉄の処女・ウロボロス戦にマグナムショットを温存する。",
      "ダウンした敵に対する弾薬節約のためのナイフを利用しない。地面に倒れた敵は単一のナイフ処刑で倒せる。立ち状態の戦闘のために貴重な弾薬を節約する。"
    ]
  },
